website : collection of webpages that are connected together browser
webpage : It is a document that displays content in the browsers.

static webpage: it is webpage where the content is fixed
HTML - structure
css -styling
bootstrap 

Dynamic webpage : where user can interact 
JS - dynamic nature
framework - collection of pre defined code
react-js   - framework

HTML (hypertext markup language)
------
hypertext - text reference to other text 
markup - a set of rules that defines how content should be displayed

It is a standard markup language that is used to create structure for 
webpage .it contains series of elements that are represented by tags

tags 
----
<reserved word> open tag
</reserved word>


element
open tag + content + closing tag 


container tags or pair tags 
<res>content</res>

<!Doctype html>--- delcaration 
it is root element to the webpage 

<1 -- 
ctrl /---comment 
-->

heading tags 
------------
h1-h6

paragraph 
---------
p tag is used to define paragraph text 
          
anchor tag
-----------
is used for external and internal routing
        
external routing 
absolute -- which have complete URL 
<a href="link"></a>    


attributes
----------- 
which provide extra information about the tag
href = 'link'
target = '_self' - displays within the page
target = '_blank' - displays another page 

list tags
---------
ordered list
------------
orered list is defined with ol tags - <ol></ol>
list items are defined with li tags - <li></li>

unordered list
--------------
unordered list is defined with ul tag <ul></ul>
list items are defined with li tags <li></li>